   "h": "Margin at the generator protects the point of use",
   "body": [
    "PW is the bulk water for non-parenteral formulation, the final rinse of most cleaning cycles and the feed to Water for Injection (WFI) stills and Pure Steam generators. USP and Ph. Eur. apply their limits at the point of use, after storage and distribution have had their effect.",
    "So the generator's job is margin. Carbon dioxide (CO₂) taken up through a tank vent raises conductivity. A loop that warms in summer adds microbial risk. We size the skid so its outlet sits well below the limit you release against under the worst feed water of the year, and we show that margin at FAT and again at site acceptance testing (SAT).",
    "Adjacent uses: the same RO and EDI platform is used for hospital reprocessing water (CSA Z314), laboratory reagent water (ASTM D1193) and industrial demineralized water. [State Aquemi's scope for hospital, laboratory and industrial water: new systems, upgrades of existing systems, service only, or not offered.] This page describes the pharmaceutical build."
